uce it, middleware can match against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"it, the engine evaluates it left-to-right and reports the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component results as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".multiple([...])"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"executeBatch"},{"type":"text","text":" is an "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"execution mode"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". The store iterates the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commands, accepts partial success unless "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopOnFailure: true"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and coalesces observation: the SwiftUI state stays correct after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each step but only one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onChange"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"events"},{"type":"text","text":" event surfaces at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"end. Use it for analytics-clean compound actions (“complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checkout: replace stack + dismiss modal”)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"executeTransaction"},{"text":" is an ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"atomicity mode"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". The store applies","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each command to a shadow stack, journals what middleware accepted","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or rejected, and only commits if every step succeeds. On failure,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the journal walks back through the discarded acceptances so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"middleware see consistent before\/after states. Use it for"},{"type":"text","text":